        <h3>Where January 9 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first week at number one: "Raindrops Keep Fallin' on My Head," "You're So Vain," "Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds," "Saturday Night," "You Don't Have to Be a Star (To Be in My Show)" and "Too Much Heaven."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} was in the middle of a longer run: "My Sweet Lord."</li>
          <li>{{N_LAST}} were in the last week of their run: "Brand New Key," "Time in a Bottle" and "How Deep Is Your Love."</li>
        </ul>

